cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Gemelo Operativo para la Transición a Vans Eléctricas"
message: "If you use this software or its analysis, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Fidalgo Martins"
    given-names: "Miguel"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mfidalgomartins/gemelo-operativo-industrial-ev-vans"
url: "https://mfidalgomartins.github.io/gemelo-operativo-industrial-ev-vans/"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible operational digital twin that identifies where production flow
  breaks during an electric-vehicle ramp-up, quantifies the cost, and ranks the
  levers that recover it. Built on deterministic synthetic data, a DuckDB SQL
  layer, and a Python analytical stack (diagnostics, parametric scenarios, an
  Operational Priority Index with Monte Carlo stability, and a release gate).
keywords:
  - analytics
  - digital-twin
  - duckdb
  - electric-vehicles
  - manufacturing
  - operations-research
  - supply-chain
